				},
				{
					"id": 401960202,
					"content": "（嗯，也可能是因為其中有不少便衣警衛吧。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960203
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401960203,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，那個…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960204,
					"content": "咳咳！派蒙有點餓了，我們去餐廳看看菜單吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960205,
					"content": "（拿著這個箱子的人，應該就是前來交易的傢伙了吧。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960206
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401960206,
					"content": "（那麼，接下來就是正題了。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960207
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401960207,
					"content": "可惡，就這樣把人拖過來…這是輕視生命的舉動！我要去審判庭告你！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格爾望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960208,
					"content": "是嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960209,
					"content": "我倒是覺得，我好心將你從「觀眾」面前帶走，是在維護你的面子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960210,
					"content": "至於你在途中是頭朝上還是頭朝下，不是你自己的選擇嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960211,
					"content": "你…！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格爾望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960212,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格爾望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960213,
					"content": "好吧、好吧，我承認，是我不對。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格爾望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960214,
					"content": "唉…我當然知道什麼是對什麼是錯，但實在沒辦法，因為我真的很需要這筆錢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格爾望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960215,
					"content": "我本來是研究古遺蹟的專家，家庭美滿、工作順利。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格爾望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960216,
					"content": "但誰能想到，自己的兒子竟然被人蠱惑，陷入了賭博的泥沼…家裡本來有些積蓄，但架不住錢就像瀑布一樣流走…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格爾望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960217,
					"content": "欠債以後，他時常遭到債主威脅恐嚇，我作為親生父親，又怎麼能眼睜睜看著他遭遇這種事呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格爾望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960218,
					"content": "唉，我兒子年紀跟你差不多，如果他也能像你一樣健康成長就好了…所以我才需要錢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格爾望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960219,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960220,
					"content": "你…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格爾望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960221,
					"content": "求求你了，小夥子，幫幫忙吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格爾望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960222,
					"content": "看在我們都是納塔同胞的份上，饒我一命！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格爾望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960223,
					"content": "如果我回去，還有機會管教好我那不爭氣的兒子。但如果我被抓，他可能就只有死路一條了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格爾望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960224,
					"content": "身為家人，理應為了更好的未來一起奮鬥的，對吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格爾望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960225,
					"content": "我們全家的機會都在你的手上了，求求你，高抬貴手吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格爾望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960226,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960227,
					"content": "哈哈，基尼奇、基尼奇，怎麼不說話？難道心軟了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿喬"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960228,
					"content": "哼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960229
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960229,
					"content": "我不會相信你說的任何一句話。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960230
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960230,
					"content": "萊歐斯利還真是猜對了八成，你就是一個徹頭徹尾的賭徒。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960231,
					"content": "呃，賭徒？我？怎麼可能，都說了是我兒子…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960232
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格爾望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960232,
					"content": "首先，你真的是納塔人嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960233,
					"content": "如果你一直關心著那把槍的動向，應該不會連一個熟悉的面孔都認不出。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960234
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960234,
					"content": "而比起這個，說「審判庭」的時候倒是順口得很。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960235
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960235,
					"content": "什麼啊，就憑這個…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960236
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格爾望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960236,
					"content": "我，我可以解釋的！我…我其實是從小生活在…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960237
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格爾望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960237,
					"content": "嘖，真是一句話都不想再聽了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960238
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960238,
					"content": "阿喬，給你一個堵別人嘴的機會，怎麼樣？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960239
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960239,
					"content": "哈哈哈，等你這句話好久了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960240
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿喬"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960240,
					"content": "不要臉的老東西，吃我一拳！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960241
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿喬"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960241,
					"content": "賭徒的特徵之一就是謊話連篇。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960242
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960242,
					"content": "我猜你只是假扮成納塔人的楓丹人罷了，身邊也沒有什麼家人朋友。即便有，他們也早就因為你的不知羞恥離去了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960243
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960243,
					"content": "當然，我也有猜錯的可能。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960244
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960244,
					"content": "——但那又如何？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960245
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960245,
					"content": "我只負責抓人，既不是你的代理人，也不是你的貼心聽眾。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960246
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960246,
					"content": "而從你口中挖出真相，是你最喜歡的審判庭的職責。對吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960247
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960247,
					"content": "沒錯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960248
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏沃蕾"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960248,
					"content": "基尼奇先生，好久不見。這名犯人就由特巡隊接管了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960249
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏沃蕾"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960249,
					"content": "啊，辛苦妳們了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960250
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960250,
					"content": "哪裡，還是要再次感謝你的鼎力協助。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960251
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏沃蕾"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960251,
					"content": "我的呢？我的呢？無禮！難道不應該向偉大聖龍表達誠摯感謝嗎！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960252
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿喬"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960252,
					"content": "那好吧，謝謝你和咔庫庫先生的精彩演出。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960253
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏沃蕾"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960253,
					"content": "啊——什麼意思啊妳，站住——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960254
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿喬"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960254,
					"content": "基尼奇，你還好嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960255
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401960255,
					"content": "被一路拖行的人又不是我，放心吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960256
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960256,
					"content": "感覺你剛剛心情不好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960257
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401960257,
					"content": "噗噗，小小基尼奇，是想起小小小小基尼奇的事情了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960258
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿喬"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960258,
					"content": "可別哭哭啼啼的哦！偉大聖龍要是有這麼懦弱的下僕，也是會沒面子的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960259
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿喬"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960259,
					"content": "什麼跟什麼…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960260
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960260,
					"content": "阿喬，壞。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960261
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401960261,
					"content": "#也沒有瞞{F#妳}{M#你}的必要，簡單來講，我的確很討厭賭徒。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960262
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960262,
					"content": "他們是世界上最沒有責任心、最不尊重付出與回報的人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960263
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960263,
					"content": "為了一枚硬幣，他們可以編出千萬個謊言，再妄圖透過這枚硬幣，賭出千萬的財富。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960264
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960264,
					"content": "但我們都清楚，憑空得到的東西，背後總暗藏著無法想像的代價。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960265
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960265,
					"content": "我從前的生活已經是我父親賭輸代價的一部分了。如果可以，我不希望有其他人陷入類似的境遇。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960266
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960266,
					"content": "基尼奇…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960267
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401960267,
					"content": "不用為我難過，我自己也並不覺得難過。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960268
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960268,
					"content": "都說人是由過去組成。而既然我能走到現在這一步，那表示我一定做對了很多很多事情。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960269
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960269,
					"content": "不要因他人的過失懲戒自己。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960270
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960270,
					"content": "我的話，會選擇記得那些讓我成長的瞬間。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960271
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960271,
					"content": "就像我第一次學會使用鉤索——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960272
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960272,
					"content": "第一次渴求知識的時候。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960273
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960273,
					"content": "我明白了。",
